#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-bundle.md:43
msgid ""
"`nix bundle`, by default, packs the closure of the [_installable_](./nix."
"md#installables) into a single self-extracting executable. See the "
"[`bundlers` homepage](https://github.com/NixOS/bundlers) for more details."
msgstr ""

